        "description": "Ping++ is a new mobile payment integration method. By using the SDK provided by Ping++, your product can simultaneously support various mainstream payment channels. Ping++ also provides a transaction management platform, allowing you to manage transactions across all payment channels effectively, reducing your upfront development and subsequent management costs.",
